        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>The top 5 and bottom 5 areas with highest average AQI.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Contains data from last 6 months: December 2024 to May 2025.</run>
          </formatted-text>
